      "hizbQuarter": 201,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4517,
      "text": "When Our clear verses are recited to them, those who disbelieve say about the truth when it comes to them, “This is clear magic.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 46,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡقَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahqaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dunes",
        "numberOfAyahs": 35,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 503,
      "ruku": 438,
      "hizbQuarter": 201,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4518,
      "text": "Or do they say, “He has fabricated it”? Say, “If I did fabricate it, there is nothing you can do to protect me against Allah. He knows best that in which you indulge[2]. He is Sufficient as a witness between me and you, and He is the All-Forgiving, the Most Merciful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 46,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡقَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahqaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dunes",
        "numberOfAyahs": 35,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 503,
      "ruku": 438,
      "hizbQuarter": 201,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4519,
      "text": "Say, “I am not the first of the messengers[3], nor do I know what will happen to me or to you. I only follow what is revealed to me, and I am not but a clear warner.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 46,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡقَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahqaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dunes",
        "numberOfAyahs": 35,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 503,
      "ruku": 438,
      "hizbQuarter": 201,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4520,
      "text": "Say, “What do you think, if this [Qur’an] is really from Allah and yet you reject it, and a witness[4] from the Children of Israel has testified in its favor and believed[5], whereas you persist in arrogance[6]? Indeed, Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 46,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡقَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahqaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dunes",
        "numberOfAyahs": 35,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 503,
      "ruku": 438,
      "hizbQuarter": 201,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4521,
      "text": "The disbelievers say about the believers, “If this [faith] were something good, they[7] would not have believed in it before us.” Now since they are not guided by it, they will say, “This is an old fabrication.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 46,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡقَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahqaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dunes",
        "numberOfAyahs": 35,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 503,
      "ruku": 439,
      "hizbQuarter": 201,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4522,
      "text": "And before it was the Scripture of Moses a guide and a mercy. This Book is a confirmation of it, in the Arabic language, in order to warn those who do wrong and give glad tidings to those who do good.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 46,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡقَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahqaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dunes",
        "numberOfAyahs": 35,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 503,
      "ruku": 439,
      "hizbQuarter": 201,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4523,
      "text": "Indeed, those who say, “Our Lord is Allah”, then remain steadfast, they will have no fear, nor will they grieve.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 46,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَحۡقَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Ahqaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Dunes",
